Package: prime-lc-lcd
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Anderson Leite <andersonleite@outlook.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), passwd, udev
Recommends: systemd
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/vakaobr/prime-lc-lcd
Description: live CPU/GPU readings on the ASUS PRIME LC ARGB LCD cooler screen
 Feeds CPU and GPU temperature, load and clock to the LCD of the ASUS
 PRIME LC ARGB LCD all-in-one cooler (USB 0b05:1bbe), replacing the
 Windows-only vendor utility. Reads NVIDIA GPUs through NVML and AMD GPUs
 through sysfs. Runs as an unprivileged systemd service.
